**Node: `ringKrullDim_ge_of_isIntegral`** (root, direction 2).

For a *faithful* integral extension $A \to B$ (i.e. $\mathrm{algebraMap}\ A\ B$ injective),
$\dim A \le \dim B$: lying over (`Ideal.exists_ideal_over_prime_of_isIntegral`) plus going up
